specModel.text:
DATA MODEL
Day { id, name, warmup: Routine[], cooldown: Routine[], parts: BodyPart[] }
Routine { id, name, video? }
BodyPart { id, name, exercises: Exercise[] }
Exercise { id, name, video?, sets: Set[] }
Set { id, weight, reps, last?: { weight, reps } }
  last = what was done in the previous saved session

Session (history entry) { id, at (ISO date-time), dayName, parts, minutes,
  warm: [done, total], cool: [done, total],
  exercises: [{ name, up, sets: [{ weight, reps }] }] }

"Up" = top weight beats last time's top weight, or same weight with more total reps.
Weight step: each tap of + / − changes the weight by exactly 0.1 (kg or lb), e.g. 60.0 → 60.1 → 60.2. Never jump by 2.5 or 5. Weight 0 shows as BW (bodyweight).
Keep everything on the device (e.g. IndexedDB).

